  "description": {
    "raw": "When laying your hand upon a creature, you channel negative energy that deals 1d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +5).\n\nSince undead are powered by negative energy, this spell cures such a creature of a like amount of damage, rather than harming it.",
    "search_text": "Inflict Light Wounds channels negative energy by touch. It deals a living creature 1d8 damage plus 1 per caster level, maximum +5, with a Will save for half and spell resistance. It cures an undead creature by the same amount instead of harming it.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Description",
        "body": "When laying your hand upon a creature, you channel negative energy that deals 1d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +5).\n\nSince undead are powered by negative energy, this spell cures such a creature of a like amount of damage, rather than harming it."
      }
